{"id":"4905b9f2ba0c83f8","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-borel-cantelli.md","title":"Borel–Cantelli Lemmas","display":"thm-borel-cantelli — Borel–Cantelli Lemmas","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-borel-cantelli","aliases":["58-thm-borel-cantelli"],"display":"thm-borel-cantelli — Borel–Cantelli Lemmas","depends_on":["[[58-df-probability-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-events]]","[[58-df-convergent-series]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-borel-cantelli"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-borel-cantelli</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-borel-cantelli — Borel–Cantelli Lemmas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b05d3f949b1c4d95\" href=\"?note=b05d3f949b1c4d95\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-events\">58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-events</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6af3724906d8a547\" href=\"?note=6af3724906d8a547\" title=\"58-df-convergent-series\">58-df-convergent-series</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,A,p\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,A,p\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[0,1]^\\omega\">\\(p\\in[0,1]^\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\)</span> (probability-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEvents}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEvents}_S\\)</span> (two-event independence predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S\\)</span> (convergent-series predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}borel\\text{-}cantelli}\\vdash\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in[0,1]^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p(n)=\\mathbb P(A(n)))\\land\\exists S\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S(p,S)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{N\\in\\omega}\\bigcup_{n\\geq N}A(n)\\right)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}borel\\text{-}cantelli}\\vdash\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in[0,1]^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p(n)=\\mathbb P(A(n)))\\land\\exists S\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S(p,S)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{N\\in\\omega}\\bigcup_{n\\geq N}A(n)\\right)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}borel\\text{-}cantelli\\text{-}converse}\\vdash\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(m\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEvents}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,A(m),A(n))\\bigr)\\land\\forall K\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(K&lt;\\sum_{n&lt;N}\\mathbb P(A(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{N\\in\\omega}\\bigcup_{n\\geq N}A(n)\\right)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}borel\\text{-}cantelli\\text{-}converse}\\vdash\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(m\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEvents}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,A(m),A(n))\\bigr)\\land\\forall K\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(K&lt;\\sum_{n&lt;N}\\mathbb P(A(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{N\\in\\omega}\\bigcup_{n\\geq N}A(n)\\right)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first implication requires no independence.</li>\n<li>The divergent-sum converse is stated with pairwise independence, which suffices; the unbounded finite-partial-sum clause gives the exact meaning of divergence for the nonnegative probability sequence.</li>\n<li>The convergence premise uses the registered series predicate rather than the unrelated submodule-sum atom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-events","status":"resolved","id":"b05d3f949b1c4d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-events]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-convergent-series","status":"resolved","id":"6af3724906d8a547","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-convergent-series]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}$ (probability-space predicate, see [[58-df-probability-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,A,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[0,1]^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEvents}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}borel\\text{-}cantelli}\\vdash\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in[0,1]^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p(n)=\\mathbb P(A(n)))\\land\\exists S\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S(p,S)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{N\\in\\omega}\\bigcup_{n\\geq N}A(n)\\right)=0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}borel\\text{-}cantelli\\text{-}converse}\\vdash\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(m\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEvents}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,A(m),A(n))\\bigr)\\land\\forall K\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(K<\\sum_{n<N}\\mathbb P(A(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{N\\in\\omega}\\bigcup_{n\\geq N}A(n)\\right)=1.","display":true}],"bytes":1917,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4050","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-borel-cantelli.md|58-thm-borel-cantelli]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["0578a357a86e9d8f","b05d3f949b1c4d95","6af3724906d8a547"]}